Subject: [PATCH 14/16] feat(web): show host CPU, memory and storage in thread
 details

CPU groups hardware threads under their physical core; the core breakdown
is a client setting toggled from the card's context menu. Extends
server.getHostResources with optional fields; drop when pingdotgg/t3code#36693 merges.
